The '''Revenant Sycophant''' is  [[Mob]] and [[Revenant Horror]] / [[Zombie Slayer]] {{MobCategory|Slayer Miniboss}} that has a chance to be spawned when a player with an active [[Revenant Horror]] {{SlayerTier|III}} or higher Quest kills a [[Zombie]]-type Mob. When this happens, an explosion effect takes place and the Revenant Sycophant spawns.

